Subject: [PATCH] pmdomain: mediatek: build the MT7988 TOPS power controller

Use the MT7988-specific power domain provider carried as a source overlay.
The TOPS domains keep their hardware default-off policy until a consumer
attaches; Ethernet domain ownership and existing clocks are unchanged.
---
--- a/drivers/pmdomain/mediatek/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/pmdomain/mediatek/Makefile
@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
 obj-$(CONFIG_MTK_SCPSYS)		+= mtk-scpsys.o
 obj-$(CONFIG_MTK_SCPSYS_PM_DOMAINS) 	+= mtk-pm-domains.o
+obj-$(CONFIG_MTK_SCPSYS_PM_DOMAINS)	+= mtk-pm-domains-mt7988.o
